# Build output from scripts/package.sh — the .app, the .dmg and the .zip.
#
# Scoped here rather than in the repository root because it is the app's build
# output and the app's tracks own it. Releases are published as GitHub release
# assets by .github/workflows/app-release.yml; a binary in git is a copy of an
# artifact that is already versioned somewhere better.
dist/

# XcodeGen output. Regenerate with `xcodegen generate`; pbxproj is
# machine-written XML and conflicts badly. Also covered by the root .gitignore —
# repeated here so a `git add app/` from inside this directory cannot pick it up
# if that line ever moves.
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace
.xcbuild/
